<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Knights Gold says in talks.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Knights Gold says in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African firm Knights Gold Mining Co Ltd said on Monday that it is in talks which could have an impact on its share price.</p>
<p>The firm urged shareholders to exercise caution in their dealings in its shares.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
